B010C007V010	10	7	10	Tena nitawaagizia mahali watu wangu Israeli, nami nitawapanda, wapate kukaa mahali pao wenyewe, wasiondolewe tena; wala wana wa uovu hawatawatesa tena, kama hapo kwanza;
