B011C022V017	11	22	17	Akasema, Naliwaona Waisraeli wote wametawanyika milimani, kama kondoo wasio na mchungaji. Bwana akasema, Hawa hawana bwana; na warudi kila mtu nyumbani kwake kwa amani.
B011C022V018	11	22	18	Mfalme wa Israeli akamwambia Yehoshafati, Je! Sikukuambia, hatanibashiria mema, ila mabaya?
