B011C022V020	11	22	20	Bwana akasema, Ni nani atakayemdanganya Ahabu, ili akwee Ramoth-Gileadi akaanguke? Basi huyu akasema hivi; na huyu hivi.
B011C022V021	11	22	21	Akatoka pepo, akasimama mbele za Bwana, akasema, Mimi nitamdanganya.
