B012C002V020	12	2	20	Akasema, Nileteeni chombo kipya, mtie chumvi ndani yake. Wakamletea.
B012C002V021	12	2	21	Akatoka akaenda mpaka chemchemi ya maji, akatupa ile chumvi humo ndani, akasema, Bwana asema hivi, Nimeyaponya maji haya; hakutatoka huko tena kufa wala kuzaa mapooza.
