B019C040V017	19	40	17	Nami ni maskini na mhitaji, Bwana atanitunza. Ndiwe msaada wangu na mwokozi wangu, Ee Mungu wangu, usikawie.
B019C041V001	19	41	1	Heri amkumbukaye mnyonge; Bwana atamwokoa siku ya taabu.
