B019C147V009	19	147	9	Humpa mnyama chakula chake, Wana-kunguru waliao.
B019C147V010	19	147	10	Hapendezwi na nguvu za farasi, Wala hairidhii miguu ya mtu.
B019C147V011	19	147	11	Bwana huwaridhia wao wamchao, Na kuzitarajia fadhili zake.
B019C147V012	19	147	12	Msifu Bwana, Ee Yerusalemu; Msifu Mungu wako, Ee Sayuni.
