B020C001V024	20	1	24	Kwa kuwa nimeita, nanyi mkakataa; Nimeunyosha mkono wangu, asiangalie mtu;
B020C001V025	20	1	25	Bali mmebatilisha shauri langu, Wala hamkutaka maonyo yangu;
B020C001V026	20	1	26	Mimi nami nitacheka siku ya msiba wenu, Nitadhihaki hofu yenu ifikapo;
