B020C008V033	20	8	33	Sikieni mafundisho, mpate hekima, Wala msiikatae.
B020C008V034	20	8	34	Ana heri mtu yule anisikilizaye, Akisubiri sikuzote malangoni pangu, Akingoja penye vizingiti vya milango yangu.
