B040C015V025	40	15	25	Naye akaja akamsujudia, akisema Bwana, unisaidie.
B040C015V026	40	15	26	Akajibu, akasema, Si vema kukitwaa chakula cha watoto na kuwatupia mbwa.
B040C015V027	40	15	27	Akasema, Ndiyo, Bwana, lakini hata mbwa hula makombo yaangukayo mezani pa bwana zao.
B040C015V028	40	15	28	Ndipo Yesu akajibu, akamwambia, Mama, imani yako ni kubwa; na iwe kwako kama utakavyo. Akapona binti yake tangu saa ile.
