B040C015V035	40	15	35	Akawaagiza mkutano waketi chini;
B040C015V036	40	15	36	akaitwaa ile mikate saba na vile visamaki, akashukuru akavimega, akawapa wanafunzi wake, nao wanafunzi wakawapa makutano.
B040C015V037	40	15	37	Wakala wote wakashiba; wakayaokota masazo ya vipande vya mikate makanda saba, yamejaa.
B040C015V038	40	15	38	Nao waliokula walikuwa wanaume elfu nne, bila wanawake na watoto.
B040C015V039	40	15	39	Akawaaga makutano, akapanda chomboni, akaenda pande za Magadani.
B040C016V001	40	16	1	Wakamjia Mafarisayo na Masadukayo, wakamjaribu, wakamwomba awaonyeshe ishara itokayo mbinguni.
