B040C016V022	40	16	22	Petro akamchukua, akaanza kumkemea, akisema, Hasha, Bwana, hayo hayatakupata.
B040C016V023	40	16	23	Akageuka, akamwambia Petro, Nenda nyuma yangu, Shetani; u kikwazo kwangu; maana huyawazi yaliyo ya Mungu, bali ya wanadamu.
B040C016V024	40	16	24	Wakati huo Yesu aliwaambia wanafunzi wake, Mtu ye yote akitaka kunifuata, na ajikane mwenyewe, ajitwike msalaba wake, anifuate.
