B040C018V028	40	18	28	Mtumwa yule akatoka, akamwona mmoja wa wajoli wake, aliyemwia dinari
B040C018V029	40	18	29	Basi mjoli wake akaanguka miguuni pake, akamsihi, akisema, Nivumilie, nami nitakulipa yote pia.
