B041C008V003	41	8	3	nami nikiwaaga waende zao nyumbani kwao hali wanafunga, watazimia njiani; na baadhi yao wametoka mbali.
B041C008V004	41	8	4	Wanafunzi wake wakamjibu, Je! Ataweza wapi mtu kuwashibisha hawa mikate hapa nyikani?
B041C008V005	41	8	5	Akawauliza, Mnayo mikate mingapi? Wakasema, Saba,
B041C008V006	41	8	6	Akawaagiza mkutano waketi chini; akaitwaa ile mikate saba, akashukuru, akaimega, akawapa wanafunzi wake wawaandikie; wakawaandikia mkutano.
