B041C009V025	41	9	25	Naye Yesu akiona ya kuwa mkutano unakusanyika mbio, akamkemea yule pepo mchafu, akamwambia, Ewe pepo bubu na kiziwi, mimi nakuamuru, mtoke huyu, wala usimwingie tena.
