B041C014V029	41	14	29	Petro akamwambia, Hata wajapokunguwazwa wote, lakini siyo mimi.
B041C014V030	41	14	30	Yesu akamwambia, Amin, nakuambia wewe, Leo, usiku huu, kabla ya kuwika jogoo mara mbili, utanikana mara tatu.
