B043C008V051	43	8	51	Amin, amin, nawaambia, Mtu akilishika neno langu, hataona mauti milele.
B043C008V052	43	8	52	Basi Wayahudi wakamwambia, Sasa tumeng'amua ya kuwa una pepo. Ibrahimu amekufa, na manabii wamekufa; nawe wasema, Mtu akilishika neno langu, hataonja mauti milele.
